  "targets": [
    {
      "name": "fdt",
      "state": "planned",
      "module": "Fdt",
      "feature": null,
      "description": "The module fdt of the provable core: the bounded parse of an untrusted flattened device tree, the access to its nodes and properties, the translation of addresses through reg, ranges and dma-ranges, the discovery of memory, of the Pi 5 boot memory and of the CPUs, the selection of boot storage on the Pi 5, the boot memory map and the functions of Span. Each function of start_from refines its specification below Krepi.Spec.Fdt: it returns the value that the specification gives, or the error that it gives in the same order, for every input of its machine widths. Planned: the functions do not exist yet, and the target names the roots that the contract of the component fixes.",
